#14103
The Atrium~
   The most prominent feature of this cavernous chamber is the set of eight
huge columns, the bases of which are statues of kneeling gods, and wonders of
design and craftmanship. Climbing to twenty feet in height, each base features
a figure with a beastly head, set atop a human body, with hieroglyphics
identifying the figure. A set of stairs leads down.
~
