#14104
The Trophy Room~
   The contents of this room are a testament to the peak of Paphoset's power
before his descent into madness. Lining the walls are spears, shields, and
other spoils of battle, all of unusual, antiquated design. The heraldry and
weapon-craft of dozens of long-dead cultures are preserved here. A set of
stairs leads up.
