Paphoset's Sanctuary~
   This lavish, columned room was built to accommodate great lethargy, for the
most distinctive features are a plush divan and many soft, silken cushions, all
set on a large, raised platform at the far end of the chamber. This luxury is
in stark contrast to the room's repulsive inhabitant.
