#14195
A Secret Passage~
   Claustrophobia is beginning to set in as you continue to navigate down this
narrow crawlspace. You gasp for air, choaking on the heavy dust. Seperated from
the rest of your party by the sheer narrowness of the tunnel, your bravery 
seems to dim. Ahead and to the west, you think that you feel cool air passing
over your sweat-soaked skin. Is there an opening there, or are you beginning to
hallucinate? Darkness engulfs you; waves of paranoia wash over you. This could
be the end.
~
