#14196
The Inner Chambers~
   You stand in a cramped, circular apsis which is dominated by an icon of the
ancient called Serapis. The room's size and circular construction makes you 
feel as if you are trapped in a shaft of some sort. This room, like the atrium
to your south, seems to be abnormally clean, even though it has been left
undisturbed for thousands of years. Well, almost undisturbed...
